{"v":2,"voice":"ziggy-v2","locale":"fr","story":"d13","segments":{"title":{"file":"title.mp3","dur":2.82,"text":"Les fourmis et la feuille géante","words":[0.12,0.51,1.01,1.11,1.335,1.66],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.285,"grin"],[0.535,"small"],[0.61,"o"],[0.71,"grin"],[0.81,"small"],[0.935,"grin"],[1.21,"open"],[1.36,"small"],[1.46,"o"],[1.535,"grin"],[1.885,"smile"],[1.985,"open"],[2.06,"smile"],[2.185,"grin"],[2.345,"smile"]]},"s1":{"file":"s1.mp3","dur":25.83,"text":"Dans un grand pré plein d’herbes hautes, il y avait une petite fourmilière. Elle ressemblait à une colline de sable, avec mille petites portes. Là vivait Pico, une fourmi rousse qui portait toujours un minuscule foulard bleu. Pico était très petit, même pour une fourmi. Mais il avait un grand cœur, et des pattes qui ne s’arrêtaient jamais de trotter.","words":[0.12,0.595,0.745,1.12,1.395,1.695,2.12,2.895,3.07,3.17,3.495,3.695,4.195,5.62,5.91,6.685,6.76,6.935,7.335,7.56,8.46,8.81,9.11,9.61,10.72,11.035,11.385,12.235,12.46,12.935,13.285,13.46,13.885,14.41,14.51,15.16,15.61,16.52,16.945,17.17,17.42,18.17,18.445,18.595,18.795,20.06,20.45,20.625,21.025,21.175,21.6,22.425,22.575,22.8,23.225,23.4,23.6,24.2,24.475,24.625],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.27,"grin"],[0.345,"open"],[0.42,"smile"],[0.495,"grin"],[0.62,"o"],[0.77,"grin"],[0.895,"smile"],[0.97,"open"],[1.145,"small"],[1.22,"grin"],[1.42,"small"],[1.495,"grin"],[1.77,"smile"],[1.845,"grin"],[1.995,"small"],[2.145,"smile"],[2.245,"o"],[2.395,"grin"],[2.695,"smile"],[2.92,"grin"],[3.195,"open"],[3.27,"small"],[3.37,"grin"],[3.52,"o"],[3.595,"grin"],[3.72,"small"],[3.795,"grin"],[4.22,"small"],[4.295,"o"],[4.37,"grin"],[4.445,"small"],[4.52,"grin"],[4.745,"smile"],[4.895,"grin"],[5.105,"smile"],[5.735,"grin"],[6.21,"open"],[6.285,"smile"],[6.36,"small"],[6.435,"grin"],[6.71,"open"],[6.785,"o"],[6.835,"grin"],[7.035,"o"],[7.11,"grin"],[7.66,"smile"],[7.785,"open"],[7.885,"small"],[7.985,"grin"],[8.26,"smile"],[8.485,"open"],[8.56,"small"],[8.635,"grin"],[8